title: "appn-linked data - APPN linked data tools"
abstract: "Linked-data tools used across the Australian Plant Phenotyping Network ([APPN](https://[plantphenomics.org.au/])) network, including: Schema definitions for APPN data; Vocabularies containing reusable definitions for APPN facilities, equipment and concepts; Python tools to create, manipulate and query linked-data assets"
